OL,3,GNEWSA'Our first home came with #40,000 
OL,4,Ain unpaid fines'                       
OL,6,FA couple have said they were repeatedly
OL,7,Fvisited by bailiffs after moving into  
OL,8,Ftheir first home together due to more  
OL,9,Fthan #40,000 in unpaid traffic fines   
OL,10,Fbeing wrongly linked to their address. 
OL,12,FGreen councillor Ed Fraser said he and 
OL,13,Fhis partner found that drivers from    
OL,14,Facross the country had been using their
OL,15,Fnew Bristol address to avoid paying    
OL,16,Fpenalties.                             
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
