OL,3,GNEWSA'Our first home came with #40,000 
OL,4,Ain unpaid fines'                       
OL,6,F"It really affected us. We had bailiffs
OL,7,Fat the door for months and months when 
OL,8,Fwe bought our first flat together. It  
OL,9,Fwas very hard," he told Bristol City   
OL,10,FCouncil's audit committee meeting on   
OL,11,FTuesday.                               
OL,13,FA council officer said records were    
OL,14,Fupdated once a bailiff attends a       
OL,15,Fproperty and finds the offender is no  
OL,16,Flonger a resident.                     
